cer. I would really appreciate it if you provide an assessment of Mrs\nStarkovic and further management of her condition including the possibility of surgical management.\n\nFor any queries, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nYours sincerely\n\nDoctor\n\nReport\n\nWord length\nComments\nEstimated Grade\nAdvice\n\nHelpful links\n\n189\nThis is a very well written letter!\nB+ or A\n1. Always proofread the letter after finishing it.\n2. Keep up the good work!\nhttps://www.benchmarkedu.com.au/oet-reading-\npractice-tests\nhttps://www.benchmarkedu.com.au/oet-writing-\ncorrection\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/oethelp\n\n296 Henley Beach Rd, Underdale, 5032\nhttp://www.benchmarkedu.com.au/oet-writing-correction\nwww.benchmarkedu.com.au/pteoetielts\n\nComment [teacher1]: days\n\nComment [teacher2]: The\n\nComment [teacher3]: a", "layout": {"version": 1, "width": 841.92, "height": 1190.64, "blocks": [{"text": "Ticket Id: 25298", "lines": [{"text": "Ticket Id: 25298", "x": 0.5240046560243254, "y": 0.049343210374252496, "width": 0.09857444887875327, "height": 0.010784116105623869, "confidence": 1, "words": [{"text": "Ticket", "x": 0.5240046560243254, "width": 0.03710533067274798, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Id:", "x": 0.5644651748384645, "width": 0.015925028506271383, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "25298", "x": 0.5838321930824782, "width": 0.03874691182060048, "confidence": 1}]}]}, {"text": "Dr Andrew McDonald\nGeneral surgeon\nNorth Melburne Private Hospital\n86 Elm Road\nNorth Melboune 3051", "lines": [{"text": "Dr Andrew McDonald", "x": 0.05829532497149373, "y": 0.07578277229053282, "width": 0.13407026795895097, "height": 0.010784116105623857, "confidence": 1, "words": [{"text": "Dr", "x": 0.05829532497149373, "width": 0.014640820980615735, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "Andrew", "x": 0.07648959521094642, "width": 0.048665478905359175, "confidence": 1}, {"text": "McDonald", "x": 0.12860176738882556, "width": 0.06376382554161913, "confidence": 1}]}, {"text": "General surg